  "text": "\r\n\t\t Voting & Elections | Londonderry, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Your Government   \t\t\t \n     Our Community   \t\t\t \n     Doing Business   \t\t\t \n     Watch   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Absentee Ballots \r\n\t\t\t Election Results \r\n\t\t\t Elections \r\n\t\t\t Filing for Office \r\n\t\t\t Voter Registration \r\nHome \nYour Government \nDepartments \nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \nVoting & Elections \r\nVoting & Elections\t\t \r\n9 \n1 \n1 \n2 \t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Absentee Ballots \r\nFind documents and information about absentee ballots in Londonderry. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Election Results \r\nLocate election results and sample ballots.  \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Elections \r\nFind information about local elections taking place in Londonderry. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Filing for Office \r\nTo sign up to run for any position, please go to the Town Clerk’s office to complete the necessary forms during normal business hours (8:30 am to 5 pm) during the filing period, \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Voter Registration \r\nThe Supervisors of the Checklist are responsible for maintaining an accurate record of voters for the Town of Londonderry. The Supervisors hold office hours in Town Hall before every election and deliberative meeting, as required by election laws. \r\nElection Officials \r\n\t\t\t\t\tJonathan Kipp\r\nTown Moderator \r\nEmail Jonathan Kipp  \r\nTerm Expires March 2027 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tSherry Farrell\r\nTown Clerk \r\nEmail Sherry Farrell  \r\nTerm Ending March 2027 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tKristin Grages\r\nChair, Supervisors of the Checklist \r\nEmail Kristin Grages  \r\nTerm Ending March 2028 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tJohn Ambrose\r\nSupervisors of the Checklist \r\nEmail John Ambrose  \r\nTerm Ending March 2032 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tJoseph Stelmach\r\nSupervisors of the Checklist \r\nEmail Joseph Stelmach  \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Town Documents \r\n\t\t\t Notify Me \r\n\t\t\t Voting & Elections \r\n\t\t\t Trash & Recycling \r\n\t\t\t Town Maps \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Londonderry \r\n268B Mammoth Road \r\nLondonderry, NH 03053 \r\nPhone:  (603) 432-1100 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Community Events \n         Community News \n         FAQs \n         Online Services \n         Trash & Recycling \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
